~ start

Keeper: You again. What do you want? [ID:TEST_KEEPER_ASK]
- Who are you? [if not GameState.get_flag("test_asked_who") /] [ID:TEST_UNKNOWN_WHO]
	do GameState.set_flag("test_asked_who")
	Keeper: The keeper. Of what, nobody remembers. [ID:TEST_KEEPER_WHO]
	=> start
- Goodbye. [ID:TEST_UNKNOWN_BYE]
	Keeper: Mind the dark. [ID:TEST_KEEPER_BYE]
	=> END
